      "id": 492581,
      "username": "oguruma",
      "name": "",
      "created_at": "2026-01-26T23:09:48.245Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Other than digging though Github, is there a public roadmap for new features and such for Frappe/ERPNext?</p>\n<p>I like to develop new features via my own custom apps, and sometimes patch different bugs that I find, but sometimes I find myself wasting time because those things are often already under development, anway.</p>\n<p>Is there a public roadmap anywhere?</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/o/54ee81/{size}.png",
