    {
      "id": 492587,
      "username": "rishabgupta",
      "name": "Rishab Gupta",
      "created_at": "2026-01-27T03:15:20.373Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No public roadmap : The development is community-driven.</p>\n<p>What actually works:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Releases: <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/releases\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/releases</a> :  see what shipped</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Feature requests: <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/labels/feature-request\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/labels/feature-request</a> :  filter issues by this label</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>Open PRs: <a href=\"https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/pulls\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">https://github.com/frappe/erpnext/pulls</a> : see what’s being worked on</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Before building something, search GitHub issues/PRs for keywords. If someone’s already working on it, you can contribute there instead.</p>\n<p>The milestones, wiki roadmap, and GitHub Projects pages exist but are abandoned.</p>",
